            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.8</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Record yourself while you record the screen. Choose a camera in the new Camera menu and a round bubble appears inside the recorded area. Drag it anywhere, and click it to switch between three sizes.</li>
  <li>When recordings open in the editor, the camera can be switched on or off there before saving.</li>
  <li>Audio, camera and cursor now stay in step after a pause.</li>
  <li>Microphone and Camera now sit above After Recording in the menu.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
